# Tessera demo — the flow that exists today (A8/F.1): a stranger lands
# in a passing test suite fast. The product demo (install, ingest,
# recommend, read the ledger entry) gets its own tape at v0.1, when the
# commands are real. Regenerate: make demo  (requires vhs; the GIF is
# committed only when regenerated by CI or a maintainer).

Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Theme { "name": "zinc", "background": "#09090b", "foreground": "#fafafa", "cursor": "#6E96E8" }

Type "git clone https://github.com/atqatq/Tessera.git && cd tessera"
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Type "make test"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "python3 -m unittest discover -s reference/python/tests"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "make vectors"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 4s
